<view class="page">
  <view class="class-bar">
    <text class="current">{{className || '未选择班级'}}</text>
    <text class="link" bindtap="onGotoClasses">切换班级</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">添加学生</view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">姓名</view>
      <input class="input" placeholder="学生姓名" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">学号（新生未分配可留空）</view>
      <input class="input" placeholder="学号" value="{{studentId}}" data-field="studentId" bindinput="onInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <view class="field-label">手机号</view>
      <input class="input" type="number" placeholder="11 位手机号" value="{{phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="onInput" />
      <view class="privacy-note">
        手机号仅用于该学生的登录账号与身份识别，仅任课教师可见，不向同学展示，不作其他用途。
        录入前请确认已征得学生本人（未成年人还需监护人）同意。详见
        <text class="link" data-url="/pages/legal/index?type=privacy" bindtap="onOpenPrivacy">《隐私政策》</text>。
      </view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{!className}}" bindtap="onAdd">
      添加学生
    </button>
    <view class="muted tip">
      学号和手机号至少填一个。未分配学号时以手机号登录，学号下发后可在下方补录；
      两者都可作为登录账号，初始密码 student。
    </view>
  </view>

  <!-- 班委角色：内置三个，教师可补充 -->
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{roles.length}}">
    <view class="card-title">
      班委角色
      <text class="sub link" bindtap="onAddRole">＋ 添加角色</text>
    </view>
    <view class="role-chips">
      <view wx:for="{{roles}}" wx:key="key" class="role-chip {{item.key === 'monitor' ? 'monitor' : ''}}">
        <text>{{item.name}}</text>
        <text class="role-count">{{item.holderCount}}</text>
        <text
          wx:if="{{!item.builtin}}"
          class="role-del"
          data-key="{{item.key}}"
          data-name="{{item.name}}"
          data-count="{{item.holderCount}}"
          bindtap="onRemoveRole"
        >×</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="muted tip">
      班长可协助出示考勤二维码、本人免扫码打卡、查看本班今日考勤名单，但不能补录考勤。
      其余角色目前只作身份标识。住宿生需参加晚修打卡，走读生不需要。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="card-title">
      学生名单
      <text class="sub">
        共 {{students.length}} 人<text wx:if="{{pendingCount}}"> · {{pendingCount}} 人待分配学号</text>
      </text>
    </view>
    <view wx:for="{{students}}" wx:key="_id" class="list-item">
      <view class="main">
        <view class="title">
          {{item.name}}
          <text wx:for="{{item.cadreRoleNames}}" wx:for-item="role" wx:key="*this" class="badge {{role === '班长' ? 'badge-brand' : 'badge-muted'}} id-badge">{{role}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.lodging === 'commuting'}}" class="badge badge-warning id-badge">走读</text>
        </view>
        <view class="desc">
          <text class="{{item.studentIdAssigned ? '' : 'pending'}}">{{item.idLabel}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{item.subLabel}}"> · {{item.subLabel}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="desc">{{item.ruleLabel}}</view>
        <view class="row-actions">
          <view
            wx:if="{{!item.studentIdAssigned}}"
            class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm"
            data-key="{{item.studentId}}"
            data-name="{{item.name}}"
            bindtap="onAssignStudentId"
          >
            补录学号
          </view>
          <view
            wx:if="{{roles.length}}"
            class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm"
            data-key="{{item.studentId}}"
            bindtap="onOpenIdentity"
          >
            设置身份
          </view>
          <view
            class="btn btn-plain btn-sm"
            data-key="{{item.studentId}}"
            data-name="{{item.name}}"
            bindtap="onSetStudentRule"
          >
            专业规则
          </view>
          <view
            class="btn btn-plain btn-sm"
            data-key="{{item.studentId}}"
            data-name="{{item.name}}"
            bindtap="onResetPassword"
          >
            重置密码
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="aside">
        <text class="badge badge-success">{{item.totalScore}} 分</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{loaded && !students.length}}" class="empty">该班级暂无学生</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 设置身份弹层 -->
  <view class="sheet-mask" wx:if="{{editing}}" bindtap="onCloseIdentity">
    <view class="sheet" catchtap="noop">
      <view class="sheet-title">设置身份 · {{editing.name}}</view>

      <view class="sheet-label">住宿情况</view>
      <view class="option-row">
        <view
          wx:for="{{lodgings}}"
          wx:key="key"
          class="option {{editing.lodging === item.key ? 'on' : ''}}"
          data-key="{{item.key}}"
          bindtap="onPickLodging"
        >
          {{item.name}}
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted sheet-note">走读生无需参加晚修打卡</view>

      <view class="sheet-label">班委角色（可多选，不选即普通学生）</view>
      <view class="option-row wrap">
        <view
          wx:for="{{roles}}"
          wx:key="key"
          class="option {{editing.picked[item.key] ? 'on' : ''}}"
          data-key="{{item.key}}"
          bindtap="onToggleRole"
        >
          <text wx:if="{{editing.picked[item.key]}}">✓ </text>{{item.name}}
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="btn-row sheet-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-plain" bindtap="onCloseIdentity">取消</button>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" loading="{{savingIdentity}}" bindtap="onSaveIdentity">保存</button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
